1 REM FBCS FIL-0499
2 REM CLAIM A-11.2.2-TR155
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM 8.2.2 prod. 1, 11.2.4.2: the IF THERE line of a SET may name the end-if-line from inside
5 REM the else branch.
100 OPEN #1: NAME "FIL0499.DAT", ACCESS OUTIN, ORGANIZATION STREAM, RECTYPE INTERNAL
